1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,880
Slide 9 contrasts "YESTERDAY: REACTIVE CHATBOTS: The Linear Human Bottleneck."

2
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:13,994
Look at the left card: "Operational Mode." Synchronous, turn-based request-response loops.

3
00:00:13,994 --> 00:00:20,070
If the human steps away to eat lunch or sleep, all productivity instantly drops to zero.

4
00:00:20,970 --> 00:00:35,250
And look at the right card: "Cognitive Burden." The user is forced to micro-manage context windows, craft repetitive system instructions, and manually inspect every single output for hallucinated errors.

5
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:44,430
Furthermore, reactive chatbots have zero long-term memory across sessions unless you manually copy-paste previous chat transcripts into new prompts.

6
00:00:45,330 --> 00:00:49,606
Reactive chatbots tether human attention to a blinking cursor.

7
00:00:49,606 --> 00:00:53,470
They create digital fatigue instead of genuine leverage.

8
00:00:54,370 --> 00:01:00,060
Now let us see how modern proactive avatars solve this structural limitation.

